### API Examples for Stroyka Backend

### 1. Register new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get products with filtering (no auth required)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?page=1&limit=10&min_price=10&max_price=1000&sort_by=price&order=desc

### 4. Get single product
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### 5. Create product with image URLs (admin only - need JWT token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Молоток строительный",
  "description": "Профессиональный молоток для строительных работ",
  "price": 2499.99,
  "rating": 4.5,
  "images": [
    "https://res.cloudinary.com/cloudname/image/upload/v1/hammer1.jpg",
    "https://res.cloudinary.com/cloudname/image/upload/v1/hammer2.jpg",
    "https://res.cloudinary.com/cloudname/image/upload/v1/hammer3.jpg"
  ],
  "stock_quantity": 100
}

### 5b. Create product with Cloudinary upload (admin only, multipart)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products/upload
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Молоток строительный
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Профессиональный молоток
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

2499.99
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="stock_quantity"

100
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/1.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/2.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="3.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./fixtures/3.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 6. Get user cart (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Add item to cart
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 8. Apply promo code
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cart/apply-promo
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SAVE10"
}

### 9. Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 10. Swagger documentation
GET http://localhost:3000/api-docs